Package: lazer
Title: Read and Write the Files an Economics Team Works With
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Daniel", "Madsen", email = "danielmadsen@live.dk",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Readers and writers for the files of day-to-day statistical
    and economic work: many files at once in most formats, every sheet of
    an Excel workbook with the table found on each sheet, presentable
    Excel output, Microsoft Access databases, and Greenlandic TA files in
    both layouts. Readers check what they read, report every problem in
    one message, and stay quiet when all is well.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://dataniel.github.io/lazer, https://github.com/dataniel/lazer
